    "detailed_description": "Fruit Game is a puzzle game in which you have to make fruits grow by attaching them to each other.<br><br>Fruits fall from the top of the box and grow into large fruits when they are attached to other fruits of the same type.<br><br>The game is over when the box is overflowing because the fruit cannot grow well!<br>Aim for a high score by attaching fruits efficiently.<br><br><br>[Stock Mode]<br><br>In addition to the normal mode, there is a stock mode.<br><br>In Stock Mode, only one fruit can be stocked,<br>In the stock mode, you can stock up only one fruit, which you can drop at any time you like.<br><br>This gives you much more freedom than in Normal Mode, so you will be able to aim for a higher score.",
